<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Samson</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Samson is a hero of the Book of Judges in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hebrew-bible">Hebrew Bible</a>, a Nazirite of the tribe of Dan endowed with great strength. His exploits are set against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/philistines">Philistines</a>, who captured and blinded him after Delilah learned the secret of his hair. In the story he dies at Gaza by pulling down the temple of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dagan">Dagon</a> on himself and his captors.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/samson.jpg" alt="Samson" width="320" height="476" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Lucas Cranach the Elder · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lucas_Cranach_d.%C3%84._-_Simson_bezwingt_den_L%C3%B6wen.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
